* @param {Object} fanoutConfig - Parsed fan-out config.\n537:function applyFlatPoolAssignmentGuard(fanoutConfig) {\n538:  const rejections = collectFlatPoolGuardRejections(fanoutConfig);\n541:      ...fanoutConfig,\n543:      executors: fanoutConfig.executors.map((lineage) => ({\n544:        ...lineage,\n558:    const labelSuffix = rejection.label ? ` lineage=${rejection.label}` : '';\n559:    process.stderr.write(`[fanout-run] ${rejection.message}${labelSuffix}\\n`);\n626: * The session id a lineage's config stored at init, or null when there is none to reuse.\n"}
