ineage and executor. The fanout-run might have expected a config? Since none exists, I'll populate with the template + required fields, and set lineage.sessionId to the provided session id. Also set topic, specFolder, maxIterations 5, convergenceThreshold 0.05, stopPolicy max-iterations, progressiveSynthesis true, createdAt now.\n- run_initialized via gateway (this creates state log + ledgers? The gateway uses run-directory and existing ledgers at deep-research-audit-ledger / effect-ledger. There's already frames/0000...0001.frame. Let me check its content — maybe the fanout-run seeded the first frame. If the gateway refuses because ledger already has a head for a different run, we'll see.\n- strategy.md from template with key questions.\n- findings-registry.json.\n\nAlso create prompts/, iterations/, deltas/ dirs.\n\nLet me check the existing frame content to understand what seeded it."}
