p and a recovery pointer to /speckit:resume, with no purpose section.\",\"iteration\":2,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/hooks/dsh/session-compact-context.mjs:126-142\",\".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/hooks/pi/session-compact-context.ts:148-165\",\".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/hooks/devin/post-compaction.cjs:265-285\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter002-004\",\"severity\":\"P0\",\"label\":\"The authored-continuity snapshot's Goal facet is built from next_safe_action, so the injected block labels an imperative action as the goal instead of the packet's purpose.\",\"iteration\":2,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/lib/continuity/thin-continuity-record.ts:289-303\",\".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/lib/continuity/thin-continuity-record.ts:307-313\",\".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/lib/continuity/authored-continuity-snapshot.ts:104-115\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter002-005\",\"severity\":\"P0\",\"label\":\"/speckit:resume emits a resume packet with only now, last, next, blockers and artifact slots, and the same file contradicts itself on whether spec.md is read: one ladder includes it, the priority order and step-2 activities omit it.\",\"iteration\":2,\"sources\":[\".skilled/commands/speckit/assets/speckit-resume-auto.yaml:92-93\",\".skilled/commands/speckit/assets/speckit-resume-auto.yaml:106-110\",\".skilled/commands/speckit/assets/speckit-resume-auto.yaml:159-174\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter002-006\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"/speckit:handoff is the only hop with a purpose-shaped slot: the note format requires a Goal section defined as what the work is for, while prepare only adds a goal_packet pointer when a goal.md can be proven.\",\"iteration\":2,\"sources\":[\".skilled/commands/speckit/handoff.md:104-131\",\".skilled/hooks/session-relaunch/bin/session-relaunch.cjs:822\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter002-007\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"/speckit:save writes action and state only: recent_action, next_safe_action, blockers, key_files, completion_pct and question ids, upserted into the leaf document, so a save aimed at a phase parent descends past the parent's Problem & Purpose.\",\"iteration\":2,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/dist/continuity/generate-context.js:133-146\",\".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/dist/continuity/generate-context.js:76-80\",\".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/dist/continuity/generate-context.js:610-680\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter002-008\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"label\":\"The deep-loop iteration prompt carries a Research Topic, Focus Area and remaining questions but no purpose field; only the free-text topic can carry a why and a caller may pass a bare topic label.\",\"iteration\":2,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/assets/prompt-pack-iteration.md.tmpl:10-20\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter002-009\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"label\":\"The child-dispatch brief contract requires files and symbols, what was tried, frozen scope and the question, and excludes the preferred conclusion; the packet's problem, purpose and user need appear in neither list.\",\"iteration\":2,\"sources\":[\".skilled/repo-rules/delegation-and-orchestration.md:80\",\".skilled/repo-rules/delegation-and-orchestration.md:96-100\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter002-010\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"Net travel of purpose: startup none, compaction none except an action mislabeled Goal, resume no slot and inconsistent spec.md reading, handoff a writer-dependent Goal slot, save none, deep-loop a free-text topic, child brief none.\",\"iteration\":2,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/hooks/claude/session-prime.ts:230-251\",\".skilled/commands/speckit/assets/speckit-resume-auto.yaml:159-174\",\".skilled/commands/speckit/handoff.md:104-131\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/assets/prompt-pack-iteration.md.tmpl:10-20\"]}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Treating the compaction Goal facet as a purpose carrier\",\"reason\":\"The code fills the facet from next_safe_action, so the label promises the why and the content supplies an action.\",\"iteration\":2}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Treating /speckit:resume as a purpose carrier\",\"reason\":\"Its output contract has no purpose field, so a full read of spec.md cannot surface one through the resume packet.\",\"iteration\":2}","file_path":"deltas/iter-002.jsonl"}}
