tion/validation-rules.md:449\",\".skilled/commands/speckit/handoff.md:28-37\",\"specs/**/handover.md (96 files scanned)\",\"specs/**/implementation-summary.md (2870 files scanned)\",\"specs/**/spec.md (297 phase parents, 1029 parent-child pairs)\"],\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-13T21:20:00.000Z\",\"durationMs\":360000,\"graphEvents\":[]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-001\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"Packet-level handover.md uses the Handover Summary, Context Transfer and For Next Session shape with no slot for problem or purpose.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/templates/addons/handover.md.tmpl:37-84\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-002\",\"severity\":\"P0\",\"label\":\"Of 96 real packet handovers, 71 contain no purpose, problem, objective or user-need vocabulary and only 9 carry an explicit purpose-like heading, so purpose is absent rather than shortened.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\"specs/**/handover.md (96 files scanned)\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-003\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"Continuity saves are near-universal and purpose-blind: 2857 of 2870 implementation summaries carry a continuity block, while the summary template has no Purpose section.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/templates/core/implementation-summary.md.tmpl:85-149\",\"specs/**/implementation-summary.md (2870 files scanned)\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-004\",\"severity\":\"P0\",\"label\":\"None of 2315 packets with a real Purpose restates it verbatim in implementation-summary.md and none has a Purpose heading there, so the save target records delivery mechanics and never the why.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\"specs/**/implementation-summary.md (2315 packet pairs scanned)\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-005\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"Of 297 phase parents, 76 carry a placeholder or empty Purpose despite the template marking root purpose as REQUIRED parent content.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/templates/packet-types/phase-parent.spec.md.tmpl:35-37\",\"specs/**/spec.md (297 phase parents scanned)\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-006\",\"severity\":\"P0\",\"label\":\"Phase children drift rather than restate: across 1029 pairs with real purposes, zero share a 60-character run and the median word overlap is 0.067, with 700 pairs below 0.10 as children write local outcomes.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\"specs/**/spec.md (1029 parent-child pairs compared)\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-007\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"Drift is structural: the child spec is scaffolded with a local Problem & Purpose, the parent is the only carrier of the cross-phase why, and no child or save path reads the parent document.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/templates/core/spec.md.tmpl:100-112\",\".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/templates/packet-types/phase-parent.spec.md.tmpl:71\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-008\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"label\":\"The relaunch note cannot compensate at packet scale: it lives only in gitignored runtime state, no notes existed to sample, and it is neither a packet artifact nor validated.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\".skilled/commands/speckit/handoff.md:28-37\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-009\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"Of 2912 spec.md files, 2622 have a non-empty Purpose and 53 still hold the scaffold placeholder, which passes validation because parent purposes are not content-graded.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\"specs/**/spec.md (2912 files scanned)\",\".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/references/validation/validation-rules.md:449\"]}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Treating handover.md as the purpose carrier across saves\",\"reason\":\"The template has no purpose slot and 71 of 96 real handovers never mention purpose, problem, objective or user need.\",\"iteration\":3}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Treating the continuity block as a purpose carrier\",\"reason\":\"The block is present in 99.5% of summaries, yet the save target has no purpose section and no summary restates the purpose sentence.\",\"iteration\":3}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Explaining child drift as a few bad packets\",\"reason\":\"700 of 1029 measured parent-child pairs fall below 0.10 overlap, so drift is the corpus-wide default.\",\"iteration\":3}","file_path":"deltas/iter-003.jsonl"}}
