":[\".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/templates/addons/acceptance-criteria.md.tmpl:41-83\",\".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/templates/packet-types/phase-parent.spec.md.tmpl:35-37,63-68,80\",\".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/references/validation/validation-rules.md:226-228,443,449\",\".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/spec/create.sh:1875-1876\",\".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/lib/continuity/thin-continuity-record.ts:60-73\",\".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/lib/continuity/authored-continuity-snapshot.ts:104-115\",\".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/dist/continuity/generate-context.js:133-146,610-624\",\".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/hooks/claude/compact-inject.ts:365-384\",\".skilled/commands/speckit/assets/speckit-resume-auto.yaml:106-110,169-174\",\"specs/**/spec.md (297 phase parents scanned)\"],\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-13T21:26:00.000Z\",\"durationMs\":360000,\"graphEvents\":[]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-001\",\"severity\":\"P0\",\"label\":\"The measured failure has three points: an unvalidated and often empty parent purpose, a save target with no purpose slot, and recovery hops with no purpose slot; a candidate fixing one point cannot close the gap.\",\"iteration\":4,\"sources\":[\"iterations/iteration-003.md\",\"iterations/iteration-002.md\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-002\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"Parent-level acceptance criteria carry no purpose: the template holds METADATA, Given/When/Then CRITERIA and a CLOSURE STATEMENT, and adding the file to a parent contradicts the lean-trio contract and needs FILE_EXISTS and AC_CLOSURE changes.\",\"iteration\":4,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/templates/addons/acceptance-criteria.md.tmpl:41-83\",\".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/references/validation/validation-rules.md:226-228\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-003\",\"severity\":\"P0\",\"label\":\"A parent-level user story or purpose section already exists in form: the phase-parent template ships Problem & Purpose and marks root purpose REQUIRED, yet 80 of 297 parents carry an empty, placeholder or generic value, so the gap is substance and a reader, not a missing section.\",\"iteration\":4,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/templates/packet-types/phase-parent.spec.md.tmpl:35-37\",\".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/templates/packet-types/phase-parent.spec.md.tmpl:63-68\",\"specs/**/spec.md (297 phase parents scanned)\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-004\",\"severity\":\"P0\",\"label\":\"An improved parent template cannot close the gap alone: parents are exempt from anchor checks and stamped v2.2, and create.sh substitutes a generic sentence about documentation layout for the parent purpose.\",\"iteration\":4,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/references/validation/validation-rules.md:443\",\".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/references/validation/validation-rules.md:449\",\".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/spec/create.sh:1875-1876\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-005\",\"severity\":\"P0\",\"label\":\"A purpose field in the continuity block reaches the most hops per change: the block occurs in 2857 of 2870 summaries, is the second resume rung, and is rendered into the compaction snapshot, so one field travels on save, resume and compaction.\",\"iteration\":4,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/lib/continuity/thin-continuity-record.ts:60-73\",\".skilled/commands/speckit/assets/speckit-resume-auto.yaml:106-110\",\".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/lib/continuity/authored-continuity-snapshot.ts:104-115\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-006\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"The continuity-field cost is bounded to one subsystem with no corpus migration: schema and validator, generate-context payload and carry, facet source and tests, optional with fallback, sourcing from the packet or nearest ancestor with a real purpose.\",\"iteration\":4,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/lib/continuity/thin-continuity-record.ts:60-73\",\".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/dist/continuity/generate-context.js:133-146\",\".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/dist/continuity/generate-context.js:610-624\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-007\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"label\":\"A purpose line in the compaction or resume payload is cheaper per file but weaker in coverage: the hook would need a disk read under budget and the resume change helps one hop, so it complements rather than replaces the continuity field.\",\"iteration\":4,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/hooks/claude/compact-inject.ts:365-384\",\".skilled/commands/speckit/assets/speckit-resume-auto.yaml:169-174\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-008\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"The cheapest authoring fix is to stop create.sh substituting a generic parent purpose so the placeholder reaches the file and PLACEHOLDER_FILLED fails, and to bump the phase-parent stamp to v2.4 for the problem anchor while grandfathering existing parents.\",\"iteration\":4,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/spec/create.sh:1875-1876\",\".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/templates/packet-types/phase-parent.spec.md.tmpl:80\",\".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/references/validation/validation-rules.md:228\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-009\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"Ranking by coverage per unit of migration risk: the continuity purpose field first, the generator and stamp fix second, the resume/compaction line third, the parent purpose content as the prerequisite, and parent acceptance criteria last.\",\"iteration\":4,\"sources\":[\"iterations/iteration-003.md\",\"iterations/iteration-004.md\"]}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Candidate A as a purpose mechanism\",\"reason\":\"Acceptance criteria measure completion and have no why slot; adding them at the parent also breaks the lean-trio contract.\",\"iteration\":4}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Candidate C as a standalone fix\",\"reason\":\"The parent template already requires root purpose; without a stamp, validation and a real value a template edit changes nothing measured.\",\"iteration\":4}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Adding a new parent-level document to carry purpose\",\"reason\":\"The parent already has exactly one prose document; the measured problem is that its purpose is empty or generic, not missing.\",\"iteration\":4}","file_path":"deltas/iter-004.jsonl"}}
