rom next_safe_action, so the label is a false positive for purpose.\",\"iteration\":5}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"/speckit:resume as it stands\",\"reason\":\"No purpose slot in the resume packet and a contradictory spec.md read order.\",\"iteration\":5}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"The relaunch note\",\"reason\":\"Ephemeral gitignored runtime state, unvalidated, with no notes to sample.\",\"iteration\":5}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"goal.md as the general carrier\",\"reason\":\"30.5% coverage and a median 0.256 overlap with spec Purpose, so it is a partial supplement.\",\"iteration\":5}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"A validator-only fix\",\"reason\":\"Presence and token checks cannot grade meaning, and fail-closed enforcement has a 297-packet migration cost.\",\"ite","file_path":"deltas/iter-005.jsonl"},"truncated":true}
